{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ringer is a marble-inspired roguelike deck builder focused on combining various marbles to score big!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308190/extras/NewShot4.gif?t=1744514839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ringer combines the age-old game of shooting marbles into a ring with the modern deckbuilding genre.\u00a0Try your best to combine various marbles to score the maximum amount every round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308190/extras/NewSho3.gif?t=1744514839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get marbles into the ring to score, but watch out! Enemy cannons will try and knock your marbles out!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308190/extras/NewShot2.gif?t=1744514839\" />Plan ahead and use the shop to purchase what you need for victory. Use one-time power marbles to tip the odds in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<br>Can you reach the final boss? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Refraction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3308190/ebb495ee13c738bda293350d71544f8cdf52cf75.jpg"},{"name":"On Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3308190/cdb81324201cd71e923bdc49c3fdaf9a4d7378d2.jpg"},{"name":"Surf\u2019s Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3308190/905f04f6a50ca4e8faea2ce70565fd4b33a686fa.jpg"},{"name":"Celestial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3308190/05bc8849ee5fa71