static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308190/extras/Construction.png?t=1744514839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ringer is still under active development!\u00a0</strong>If you have any ideas for the game, please join the Ringer Discord!\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ringer is a marble-inspired roguelike deck builder focused on combining various marbles to score big!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308190/extras/NewShot4.gif?t=1744514839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ringer combines the age-old game of shooting marbles into a ring with the modern deckbuilding genre.\u00a0Try your best to combine various marbles to score the maximum amount every round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308190/extras/NewSho3.gif?t=1744514839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get marbles into the ring to score, but watch out! Enemy cannons will try and knock your marbles out!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308190/extras/NewShot2.gif?t=1744514839\" />Plan ahead and use the shop to purchase what you need for victory. Use one-time power marbles to tip the odds in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<br>Can you reach the final boss? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Ideas Per Second"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308190/3b69a291feb69999cf69972dcd1ba0092183f659/header.jpg?t=1744514839","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\